    Activity: 2
    Why: "the long walk in for his dinner \u2014 the middle slot at the counter"
  - StartHour: 14.5
    StationId: station.st_peters.flats_head
    Activity: 1
    Why: back out west for the afternoon tide
  - StartHour: 19
